{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04570","headline":"过汉南城叹古坟 · 张说","name":"过汉南城叹古坟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧国多陵墓，荒凉无岁年。\n汹涌蔽平冈，汩若波涛连。\n上世千金子，潜卧九重泉。\n松柏剪无余，碑记灭罔传。\n葬於不毛地，咸谓楚先贤。\n事尽情可识，使人心怅然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04570.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04570","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}